摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Seamless API-key rotation for DeepSeek Harness","id":"gh:1340558344","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-llm-key-rotation","slug":"m1khal3v/dsh-llm-key-rotation","topics":["ai-plugin","deepseek","deepseek-harness","deepseek-harness-plugin","deepseek-harness-plugins","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Seamless API-key rotation for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"dsh-llm-key-rotation"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Seamless API-key rotation for DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Hit a quota limit or 429 Rate Limit? The plugin swaps in the next key you configured and retries ins"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"tantly — no restarts, no context loss, and zero interruptions."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## ⚡️ Highlights"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- 🔄 **Invisible to Agent & User**: Request fails with quota/rate limit → plugin hot-swaps the key → "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"request retries and succeeds seamlessly.\n- 🎛 **Native Web & Desktop UI**: List every key a provider "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"can use and toggle rotation right inside Settings → Plugins.\n- 🧠 **Smart Anti-Spin**: Cooldown disci"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"pline prevents infinite loops if all your keys are exhausted.\n- 🧼 **Zero Core Patches**: Plugs clean"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"ly into the Harness recovery waterfall — safe to install, safe to remove."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## 🛠 How It Works"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"1. You keep working with your currently-active key as usual.\n2. If a request fails (`QUOTA`, `RATE_L"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"IMIT`, or `AUTH`), the plugin loads the next key from your configured chain.\n3. The turn retries wit"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"h the new key, and future requests continue with the working key."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## 🚀 Quick Start"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### 1. Install the plugin"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**Desktop app** — open the **Plugins** page and install `@m1khal3v/dsh-llm-key-rotation`. The deskto"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"p client is a web client, so the same browser-half card renders there."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**CLI / local install** — add the plugin to your web profile:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### 2. Configure via the Plugins UI"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Navigate to **Settings** → **Plugins** → **Key Rotation** tab:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"1. **Toggle on** rotation for your target provider.\n2. Select your trigger codes (default: `QUOTA`, "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"`AUTH`).\n3. Click **Add key**, paste all the keys you want that provider to rotate through, and hit "},{"id":"p17s3","text":"3. Click **Add key**, paste all the keys you want that provider to rotate through, and hit **Save**."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"*(Keys are safely saved to the Harness credential store)*."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### 3. Desktop"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Install through the desktop **Plugins** page, then open **Settings** → **Plugins** → **Key Rotation*"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"*. Keys are stored in the desktop profile's credential store. Rotation runs host-side on the same cr"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"edential seam as the web build, so a rotated key reaches the next request without restarting the app"},{"id":"p20s4","text":" the web build, so a rotated key reaches the next request without restarting the app or the session."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## ⚙️ Behavior & Good to Know"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- **Smart Rotation Window (300s):** During consecutive failures, the plugin walks forward through yo"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ur configured keys. If no failures occur for >5 minutes, the chain resets to start from the top agai"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"n.\n- **Interplay with `dsh-llm-retry`:**\n- `QUOTA` and `AUTH` rotate **immediately**.\n- `RATE_LIMIT`"},{"id":"p22s4","text":" is handled by `dsh-llm-retry` first (with backoff). To rotate instantly on 429 errors instead, simp"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"ly remove `RATE_LIMIT` from your provider's `retryableCodes`.\n- **Live Terminal Logs:** Watch rotati"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"on events in real time right in your `dsh` terminal:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"*(Secret values are never logged — only provider names, indices, and error codes).*"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## 🧑‍💻 Development"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## 📄 License"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
